Таблицы:

-------------------------------------------------------------
|                      Indexer-Data-Website                 |
|---------------------------------------------------------- |
| id_data_website       | BIGSERIAL          | PRIMARY KEY  |
| title                 | TEXT               |              |
| content               | TEXT               |              |
| hash_title_content    | VARCHAR(300)       | UNIQUE       |
| short_content         | TEXT               |              |
| id                    | VARCHAR(500)       |              |
| publish_date          | TIMESTAMP          |              |
| last_updated_time     | TIMESTAMP          |              |
| copyright             | TEXT               |              |
| base_uri              | VARCHAR(2000)      |              |
| source_feed_uri       | VARCHAR(2000)      |              |
| element_extensions    | JSONB              |              |
| attribute_extensions  | JSONB              |              |
-------------------------------------------------------------



------------------------------------------------------------
|                    Indexer-Links                         |
|----------------------------------------------------------|
| id                    | BIGSERIAL          | PRIMARY KEY |
| id_data_website       | BIGINTEGER         | FOREIGN KEY |
| uri                   | VARCHAR(2000)      | NOT NULL    |
| relationship          | VARCHAR(100)       |             |
| title                 | VARCHAR(500)       |             |
| media_type            | VARCHAR(100)       |             |
| length                | BIGINT             |             |
------------------------------------------------------------



------------------------------------------------------------
|                    Indexer-Authors                       |
|----------------------------------------------------------|
| id                    | BIGSERIAL          | PRIMARY KEY |
| id_data_website       | BIGINTEGER         | FOREIGN KEY |
| name                  | VARCHAR(500)       | NOT NULL    |
| email                 | VARCHAR(500)       |             |
| uri                   | VARCHAR(2000)      |             |
------------------------------------------------------------



------------------------------------------------------------
|                   Indexer-Contributors                   |
|----------------------------------------------------------|
| id                    | BIGSERIAL          | PRIMARY KEY |
| id_data_website       | BIGINTEGER         | FOREIGN KEY |
| name                  | VARCHAR(500)       | NOT NULL    |
| email                 | VARCHAR(500)       |             |
| uri                   | VARCHAR(2000)      |             |
------------------------------------------------------------



------------------------------------------------------------
|                    Indexer-Categories                    |
|----------------------------------------------------------|
| id                    | BIGSERIAL          | PRIMARY KEY |
| id_data_website       | BIGINTEGER         | FOREIGN KEY |
| name                  | VARCHAR(200)       | NOT NULL    |
| scheme                | VARCHAR(500)       |             |
| label                 | VARCHAR(200)       |             |
------------------------------------------------------------



------------------------------------------------------------
|                      Indexer-Words                       |
|----------------------------------------------------------|
| word                  | TEXT               |             |
| link_id               | BIGINTEGER         | FOREIGN KEY |
| (word, link_id)       |                    | PRIMARY KEY |
------------------------------------------------------------


В Indexer-Words предлагаю хранить:
 (русское слово) -    (ссылка) [se.ifmo.ru]
 (английское слово) - (ссылка) [se.ifmo.ru]

